---
title: Hot Tartar Sauce
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@butter{1%Tbsp}
@milk{1/2%c}
@flour{1%Tbsp}
@mayonnaise{1/3%c}
@chopped olives{2%tsp}
@chopped dill or sweet pickles{2%tsp}
@vinegar{1%tsp}
@onion juice{1%tsp}

Heat into white sauce, then add: @mayonnaise{1/3%c}, @chopped olives{2%tsp}, @chopped dill or sweet pickles{2%tsp}, @vinegar{1%tsp}, and @onion juice{1%tsp}.
